        <mxCell id="c47" value="&lt;b&gt;Rules.&lt;/b&gt; Feature branches are cut from the baseline. Each hop cuts a promotion branch from the TARGET and merges the feature in, so the deploy keeps the target's own changes (L1-qa survives). A branch is merged only after its org was deployed, and only if the target did not move since the cut. Environment branches are merged, never reset or force-pushed. The hub app lives on platform/sfdevops-app, git-ignored on main." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="680" width="1230" height="90" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
